WEBVTT

00:00:48.673 --> 00:00:53.345
Gor, we're riding out first, right?
We can bust 'em up, right?

00:00:53.345 --> 00:00:57.682
Yeah. Our job is to infiltrate
and shake things up from the inside.

00:00:57.682 --> 00:00:59.976
Go as wild as you want.

00:01:01.686 --> 00:01:04.731
All right, you all!
Make sure you give us good cover!

00:01:04.731 --> 00:01:07.150
But don't look to us for
help if you get in the way!

00:01:07.150 --> 00:01:08.610
Hmph! Not a chance!

00:01:08.610 --> 00:01:10.445
Yeah, yeah.

00:01:16.659 --> 00:01:20.789
I assigned Gorneo and
Shante to replace Layfon.

00:01:20.789 --> 00:01:23.917
They are the only ones
fit to replace a military artist

00:01:23.917 --> 00:01:26.836
who can also be used on solo missions.

00:01:26.836 --> 00:01:30.048
I'd hoped to put a large number
of students under their protection, but...

00:01:30.048 --> 00:01:32.592
Sorry. I've caused you extra trouble.

00:01:32.592 --> 00:01:35.595
We will soon make contact with Myath.

00:01:35.595 --> 00:01:38.181
Sir, you should prepare for the signing.

00:01:38.181 --> 00:01:41.309
Yes. That's right.

00:01:41.309 --> 00:01:44.729
The battle will begin
soon after the signing ceremony.

00:01:44.729 --> 00:01:46.481
It's almost time.

00:01:46.481 --> 00:01:49.359
I look forward to your performance, Commander.

00:01:49.359 --> 00:01:51.695
Yes, sir. Leave it to me.

00:01:52.529 --> 00:01:53.446
Sir...

00:01:53.446 --> 00:01:55.073
I know.

00:02:03.998 --> 00:02:07.002
<i>Brave your truth and brave yourself</i>

00:02:07.002 --> 00:02:10.588
<i>So we can go somewhere with the dite</i>

00:02:10.588 --> 00:02:18.304
<i>Keep hope alive, now we</i>
<i>wanna find the new world</i>

00:02:20.598 --> 00:02:23.852
<i>Roaming around the city having lost my map</i>

00:02:23.852 --> 00:02:27.188
<i>Even a dying world</i>

00:02:27.188 --> 00:02:33.987
<i>Let me hear a life deep</i>
<i>within that won't stop running</i>

00:02:33.987 --> 00:02:37.115
<i>I seared the undying light into my eyes</i>

00:02:37.115 --> 00:02:40.535
<i>Refusing to shut them</i>
<i>even when they dried</i>

00:02:40.535 --> 00:02:47.334
<i>I don't believe anything I can</i>
<i>obtain without getting hurt</i>

00:02:47.334 --> 00:02:53.465
<i>A single emotion</i>
<i>directed toward someone</i>

00:02:53.465 --> 00:03:00.722
<i>Splits the steel darkness</i>
<i>like the light of morning</i>

00:03:01.014 --> 00:03:05.393
<i>One day brave your</i>
<i>truth and brave yourself</i>

00:03:05.393 --> 00:03:08.855
<i>So you will drastically change</i>

00:03:08.855 --> 00:03:14.944
<i>Compounded strength and prayers</i>

00:03:14.944 --> 00:03:18.615
<i>Intersecting futures</i>
<i>and wishes held close</i>

00:03:18.615 --> 00:03:22.118
<i>I will give these to no one</i>

00:03:22.118 --> 00:03:23.620
<i>Just tough and alive</i>

00:03:23.620 --> 00:03:28.833
<i>It links our hearts</i>

00:03:42.180 --> 00:03:45.100
I never thought things would come to this.

00:03:53.525 --> 00:03:56.236
Something's interfering with my nen'i.

00:04:01.825 --> 00:04:04.327
All I can do is wait for help?

00:04:07.706 --> 00:04:09.124
Um...

00:04:11.960 --> 00:04:15.463
"Felli, Kidnapped"

00:04:15.714 --> 00:04:19.884
I brought you some food.
I'm sorry it's gotten late.

00:04:19.884 --> 00:04:23.471
If you have to go to the bathroom
or something, please tell me.

00:04:23.471 --> 00:04:25.765
I'll be right nearby.

00:04:30.145 --> 00:04:31.312
What's the meaning of this?!

00:04:31.312 --> 00:04:32.272
Wh-Whoa!

00:04:32.272 --> 00:04:34.774
She's the younger sister
of the student council president!

00:04:34.774 --> 00:04:37.277
Why would you kidnap someone like that?!

00:04:37.277 --> 00:04:39.821
This would seem to be escalating.

00:04:39.821 --> 00:04:42.490
Um, well, b-bye!

00:04:48.371 --> 00:04:51.082
What's more, you do it <i>now</i>,
with the battle about to begin.

00:04:51.082 --> 00:04:56.212
To yours truly, it's perfect.
Thanks to the intermunicipal battle,

00:04:56.212 --> 00:04:59.549
they can't split up their forces to come after us.

00:04:59.549 --> 00:05:02.677
Like it or not, Layfon will have to come alone.

00:05:02.677 --> 00:05:04.054
Layfon?

00:05:04.054 --> 00:05:07.557
All yours truly wants is to
settle things with him for good.

00:05:07.557 --> 00:05:10.727
I don't care what it takes to make that happen.

00:05:10.727 --> 00:05:13.104
But what if Zuellni loses as a result?

00:05:13.104 --> 00:05:15.774
If people knew this, there would be blood!

00:05:15.774 --> 00:05:18.026
Are you trying to destroy the group?!

00:05:18.026 --> 00:05:21.112
The Salinban Mercenary
Training Group would be disbanded

00:05:21.112 --> 00:05:22.364
no matter what.

00:05:22.364 --> 00:05:23.656
What?!

00:05:24.949 --> 00:05:29.662
"I will send a Sword there.
Leave the rest to that Sword."

00:05:33.750 --> 00:05:38.046
A letter arrived from the Queen of Glendan.

00:05:38.046 --> 00:05:41.132
"Send a Sword..." A Keeper
of the Heaven's Blade is coming?

00:05:41.132 --> 00:05:43.218
So now we're useless?

00:05:43.218 --> 00:05:45.887
Then what are we supposed to do?

00:05:45.887 --> 00:05:49.933
If we go to Glendan,
we'll be rewarded for the Fallen One we found.

00:05:49.933 --> 00:05:53.561
With that in hand, anyone
with a hometown can just go back.

00:05:53.561 --> 00:05:55.271
To our hometown?

00:05:55.271 --> 00:05:57.732
We can go... back home?

00:05:59.359 --> 00:06:01.486
Home... huh?

00:06:04.239 --> 00:06:06.241
Just give it back!

00:06:07.242 --> 00:06:09.244
Yours truly's home is...

00:06:19.295 --> 00:06:22.924
I wonder if Fon-Fon will come save me.

00:06:28.096 --> 00:06:31.349
Do you really think nothing of that?

00:06:31.349 --> 00:06:34.102
I believe in her.

00:06:43.611 --> 00:06:46.406
What do you intend to do once you leave?

00:06:46.406 --> 00:06:47.949
Beats me.

00:06:48.742 --> 00:06:52.620
For starters, go to a bunch
of places at random...

00:06:52.620 --> 00:06:55.665
Like the wanderer I am.

00:06:55.665 --> 00:06:57.042
Sir...

00:06:57.042 --> 00:07:00.920
Enough of that. I'm not
the group's leader anymore.

00:07:00.920 --> 00:07:05.342
And without the group,
I'm just a self-absorbed military artist.

00:07:05.342 --> 00:07:08.345
I won't be held back by anything anymore.

00:07:08.345 --> 00:07:12.515
I'll go where I like and
use my sword however I want.

00:07:13.350 --> 00:07:14.476
Is that why?

00:07:14.476 --> 00:07:15.852
Why what?

00:07:15.852 --> 00:07:19.439
Well, it occurs to me that maybe you thought

00:07:19.439 --> 00:07:24.110
you'd rather destroy it yourself
than see someone else destroy it.

00:07:24.110 --> 00:07:26.654
That's just stupid. That's not it at all.

00:07:26.654 --> 00:07:29.115
Then why did you jump the gun?

00:07:29.991 --> 00:07:32.202
My own obstinacy.

00:07:32.202 --> 00:07:33.828
Obstinacy?

00:07:34.662 --> 00:07:38.083
I'm going to teach that guy
who threw away his Heaven's Blade.

00:07:38.083 --> 00:07:40.627
Teach him <i>my </i>way of life...

00:07:43.713 --> 00:07:45.757
...and that there's a successor
to the Saiharden style

00:07:45.757 --> 00:07:49.427
right here, in the Salinban
Mercenary Training Group!

00:07:58.144 --> 00:08:01.022
I came alone, as instructed.

00:08:01.022 --> 00:08:03.358
Now give Senior Felli back.

00:08:03.358 --> 00:08:07.904
Yeah, I'll give her back.
Once our fight here is finished.

00:08:07.904 --> 00:08:09.364
Must we fight?

00:08:09.364 --> 00:08:10.990
Those are my terms.

00:08:10.990 --> 00:08:12.992
But if you don't care what happens
to your precious senior student,

00:08:12.992 --> 00:08:15.120
do as you like.

00:08:15.120 --> 00:08:18.123
I didn't know you wanted to die that badly.

00:08:36.016 --> 00:08:38.018
Not yet? Not yet?

00:08:39.394 --> 00:08:41.021
Bastard!

00:08:46.276 --> 00:08:49.446
Seems you created your world
by consuming 50 million people

00:08:49.446 --> 00:08:50.697
from Anabarrel City.

00:08:50.697 --> 00:08:54.284
How does it feel,
having that world taken away from you?

00:09:18.725 --> 00:09:20.518
Well done.

00:09:20.518 --> 00:09:23.855
Saya, don't let your protection down yet.

00:09:23.855 --> 00:09:26.733
There's still some of his influence left here.

00:09:26.733 --> 00:09:28.151
Okay.

00:09:32.405 --> 00:09:34.783
Layfon... Where are you?

00:09:34.783 --> 00:09:35.742
This way.

00:09:35.742 --> 00:09:37.160
Hurry!

00:09:39.037 --> 00:09:40.830
Huh? A civilian?

00:09:40.830 --> 00:09:42.791
Why are you wandering around here?!

00:09:42.791 --> 00:09:44.959
Hurry up and get to the shelters!

00:09:48.088 --> 00:09:49.923
What was that? Jeez!

00:09:58.098 --> 00:09:59.432
Yes.

00:10:00.016 --> 00:10:02.060
It's me. What is it?

00:10:03.019 --> 00:10:05.980
What?! Myath has changed course?

00:10:11.986 --> 00:10:13.363
What the heck?!

00:10:13.363 --> 00:10:15.156
Don't tell me they're withdrawing!

00:10:15.156 --> 00:10:16.282
What does this mean?

00:10:16.282 --> 00:10:18.284
Emergency communiqué!
Emergency communiqué!

00:10:18.284 --> 00:10:20.036
The battle's been postponed!

00:10:20.036 --> 00:10:23.748
All platoons, stand in position.
Await further orders!

00:10:23.748 --> 00:10:25.458
No way!

00:10:27.293 --> 00:10:31.297
Nina Antalk of the 17th Platoon:
the student council president

00:10:31.297 --> 00:10:35.385
has ordered you to go provide
support for Layfon Alseif immediately.

00:10:50.567 --> 00:10:52.193
Well, now.

00:11:43.036 --> 00:11:45.497
What the heck is this?

00:11:46.039 --> 00:11:49.959
Fon-Fon... He came for me?

00:11:49.959 --> 00:11:51.961
Fon-Fon. Fon-Fon!

00:11:54.381 --> 00:11:55.799
Fon-Fon!

00:12:10.313 --> 00:12:14.025
Two warriors, both of the Saiharden sword style.

00:12:14.025 --> 00:12:17.445
As fellow students, they can
read each other's attack patterns.

00:12:17.445 --> 00:12:19.823
It has been evenly matched till now...

00:12:43.096 --> 00:12:46.850
So the density of his Ballistic Kei
really isn't enough, eh?

00:12:46.850 --> 00:12:48.059
Sir!

00:12:55.775 --> 00:12:59.320
Haven't you had enough? Let's end this!

00:12:59.320 --> 00:13:01.698
You think you've won already?

00:13:01.698 --> 00:13:04.993
What meaning does this fight even have?

00:13:04.993 --> 00:13:07.662
An elite like you wouldn't understand!

00:13:07.662 --> 00:13:10.790
I've never thought of myself as "elite"!

00:13:10.790 --> 00:13:12.959
<i>That's </i>what makes you one!

00:13:12.959 --> 00:13:14.961
You're made a Heaven's Blade
as if it were only natural,

00:13:14.961 --> 00:13:17.797
then throw it all away without hesitation!

00:13:17.797 --> 00:13:20.884
Both your Heaven's Blade
and your Saiharden blade!

00:13:20.884 --> 00:13:22.635
Yours truly...

00:13:23.803 --> 00:13:26.348
Yours truly is a successor
to the Saiharden style too!

00:13:26.348 --> 00:13:28.183
I'm Ryuho's pupil!

00:13:32.937 --> 00:13:38.234
So what? That gives you
the right to abduct Senior Felli?!

00:13:53.041 --> 00:13:54.668
Fellmouse!

00:13:59.422 --> 00:14:01.841
Saiharden combat blade style...

00:14:01.841 --> 00:14:03.593
That stance!

00:14:04.344 --> 00:14:06.179
Flame-Slice!

00:14:07.681 --> 00:14:10.350
This battle's just getting started!

00:14:13.144 --> 00:14:15.313
<i>I can't read his kei flow.</i>

00:14:16.981 --> 00:14:20.276
Don't assume this will
go the same way as last time!

00:14:22.487 --> 00:14:24.364
You're goin' nowhere!

00:14:31.705 --> 00:14:34.749
Usin' a single-edged technique
with a regular sword?

00:14:34.749 --> 00:14:36.960
What a waste of energy!

00:14:41.881 --> 00:14:44.259
That is an original technique that Haia acquired

00:14:44.259 --> 00:14:48.054
through countless battles
with the mercenary group.

00:14:48.054 --> 00:14:52.809
It is not of the Saiharden style.
If its kei flow cannot be read...

00:14:52.809 --> 00:14:54.436
He can win?

00:14:58.273 --> 00:15:00.775
Fon-Fon! What's happened?

00:15:00.775 --> 00:15:02.610
Fon-Fon!

00:15:43.234 --> 00:15:44.486
Fon-Fon!

00:15:44.486 --> 00:15:45.445
Felli!

00:15:45.445 --> 00:15:47.072
Bad move!

00:15:57.791 --> 00:15:59.209
Sir!

00:16:01.336 --> 00:16:01.628
--Fon-Fon...

00:16:01.628 --> 00:16:03.254
--Stay back!
--Fon-Fon...

00:16:04.798 --> 00:16:08.551
It's still dangerous here.

00:16:08.551 --> 00:16:10.053
Fon-Fon...

00:16:11.971 --> 00:16:14.557
You're worried about your comrade,
even at a time like this?

00:16:14.557 --> 00:16:16.768
How admirable.

00:16:16.768 --> 00:16:21.314
Yours truly, on the other hand,
has no comrade he needs to protect...

00:16:21.314 --> 00:16:23.733
No home he needs to return to.

00:16:23.733 --> 00:16:27.070
All I've been left is this single sword.

00:16:30.156 --> 00:16:35.704
But by this sword,
I will prove my way of life...

00:16:35.704 --> 00:16:41.209
...and that my days
with the group weren't in vain!

00:16:41.209 --> 00:16:42.877
Haia...

00:16:42.877 --> 00:16:51.052
And that no way was Ryuho...
was my father inferior to friggin' Derk!

00:16:52.846 --> 00:16:59.519
It always ate at Ryuho that he'd
left Derk to inherit the Saiharden style

00:16:59.519 --> 00:17:03.565
while he went out into the outside world.

00:17:03.565 --> 00:17:05.358
That's why!

00:17:07.110 --> 00:17:12.115
Ah. So Derk's disciple became
a Keeper of the Heaven's Blade.

00:17:14.993 --> 00:17:17.537
Layfon Alseif...

00:17:17.537 --> 00:17:18.872
It is a good name.

00:17:18.872 --> 00:17:22.667
When he learned Derk's disciple
was made a Heaven's Blade,

00:17:22.667 --> 00:17:27.839
he was overjoyed.
That face he showed was of true happiness.

00:17:29.549 --> 00:17:32.469
But that's no good.

00:17:32.469 --> 00:17:36.514
You aren't the one that
can relieve Ryuho's burden.

00:17:36.514 --> 00:17:41.478
No one should've made
my father smile but yours truly!

00:17:41.478 --> 00:17:43.772
Haia, you...

00:17:47.442 --> 00:17:53.907
Now, beating you is the only thing
that can answer my father's wishes!

00:17:55.158 --> 00:17:59.329
Get up, Layfon Wolfstein Alseif!

00:17:59.329 --> 00:18:01.623
Now that you've become just a military artist,

00:18:01.623 --> 00:18:05.085
I will strike you down and prove Ryuho's power!

00:18:13.968 --> 00:18:16.012
You're good with this, right?

00:18:16.012 --> 00:18:19.766
You really... will die.

00:18:19.766 --> 00:18:22.060
You're the one who's gonna die!

00:19:27.417 --> 00:19:28.835
Myunfa...

00:19:31.921 --> 00:19:35.133
Yours truly lost. You get outta here.

00:19:35.133 --> 00:19:36.634
No!

00:19:36.634 --> 00:19:38.261
Don't be unreasonable.

00:19:38.261 --> 00:19:43.224
No! I won't leave you,
Haia-<i>chan</i>! I've made up my mind!

00:19:44.476 --> 00:19:44.934
--Haia!

00:19:44.934 --> 00:19:46.353
--Sir!
--Haia!

00:19:48.146 --> 00:19:51.066
You're the villain here, not me.

00:19:55.945 --> 00:19:57.572
Everyone...

00:20:09.250 --> 00:20:12.587
It's over. Everything's okay now.

00:20:12.587 --> 00:20:14.464
Fon-Fon...

00:20:14.464 --> 00:20:16.174
Fon-Fon!

00:20:16.174 --> 00:20:17.634
Fon-Fon?

00:20:21.137 --> 00:20:26.434
I'm okay. It's nothing bad.
Are <i>you </i>all right, Felli?

00:20:30.230 --> 00:20:32.232
Should've known better...

00:20:36.653 --> 00:20:38.613
Layfon! Felli...

00:20:41.032 --> 00:20:45.578
He's an idiot. Sure enough, Fon-Fon is an idiot.

00:20:45.578 --> 00:20:46.996
Felli?

00:21:00.343 --> 00:21:01.845
Leerin!

00:21:04.097 --> 00:21:05.515
Why...?

00:21:07.851 --> 00:21:10.311
You haven't changed!

00:21:10.311 --> 00:21:12.731
You haven't changed at all!

00:21:12.731 --> 00:21:15.942
Why do you do nothing
but make other people worry?

00:21:15.942 --> 00:21:18.987
Taking on everything all by yourself...

00:21:18.987 --> 00:21:22.282
name <i>one </i>person who's
been made happy by that!

00:21:22.282 --> 00:21:25.702
Leerin... Is it really...?

00:21:25.702 --> 00:21:27.037
Who is that?

00:21:27.037 --> 00:21:28.997
Is she...?

00:21:31.583 --> 00:21:34.669
Is it true that Myath
has changed its travel path?

00:21:34.669 --> 00:21:37.630
Take a look, Vanzeh. <i>This </i>is the reason.

00:21:45.555 --> 00:21:47.390
What is it?

00:21:59.819 --> 00:22:01.237
That is...

00:22:17.754 --> 00:22:22.050
the Spear-Shelled City, Glendan.

00:22:26.262 --> 00:22:36.356
<i>Hello, who are you thinking of?</i>

00:22:36.356 --> 00:22:43.446
<i>This letter still lies within my breast</i>

00:22:43.446 --> 00:22:53.498
<i>That fragment of memories</i>
<i>of you, suddenly encountered,</i>

00:22:53.498 --> 00:23:00.588
<i>has pierced my heart and I can't move</i>

00:23:00.588 --> 00:23:05.427
<i>I want you to notice, don't notice</i>

00:23:05.427 --> 00:23:09.139
<i>Do you treat me coldly because of love?</i>

00:23:09.139 --> 00:23:18.732
<i>I want to tell you "Be by my side," </i>
<i>but I can't say it</i>

00:23:19.524 --> 00:23:28.116
<i>It was in this filthy world</i>
<i>that I was able to meet you</i>

00:23:28.116 --> 00:23:39.294
<i>Please play this miracle</i>
<i>that has descended to my heart</i>

00:23:39.294 --> 00:23:47.302
<i>Zuellni my love</i>

00:23:53.767 --> 00:23:56.144
<i>Glendan's sudden appearance just prior</i>

00:23:56.144 --> 00:23:59.481
<i>to the intermunicipal battle</i>
<i>causes Myath to depart.</i>

00:23:59.481 --> 00:24:01.191
<i>Disregarding the students thrown into confusion,</i>

00:24:01.191 --> 00:24:04.361
<i>Zuellni suddenly goes rogue</i>
<i>and changes paths toward Glendan...</i>

00:24:04.361 --> 00:24:06.821
<i>Next time, "The Invincible,</i>
<i>Spear-Shelled City Glendan Draws Near!" and...</i>

00:24:06.821 --> 00:24:08.128
<i>Restoration!</i>
